/STR d1a74034
"If your worship would like to SEE the show, sit down, it's just about to start."
/STR e7ee041d
A puppet show with its little wax candles lit. The performance is about to begin. You only have to SEE it.
/STR 55ec9ff7
A tailless ape, with a bottom like felt, but not a bad face. They say he divines.
/STR 14b69a9b
Without a sword in your hand you won't rout a Moorish army, even one made of paste.
/STR 80334c2f
Whom? Master Pedro is a poor puppeteer. For the moment.
/STR 9dcfa477
