/STR e43307c4
The old man has the staff. You would have to ask him for it.
/STR 67de10bb
You think, finger on your forehead. Why did he give him the staff to hold just as he swore? What could be inside it?
/STR 0238475f
One, with the look of a man who is owed money. The other, with a staff and in a hurry.
/STR 6b427375
You can't leave without passing sentence. You are the governor.
/STR f1e89421
You have eaten. At last, and only just.
/STR 9588be77
He hasn't done anything to you yet. Try to EAT, and you'll see.
/STR 73719d5e
{i6}"I am a physician, sir, and I am here so that your worship eats what is good for you."{i7}
/STR f5cf92c6
Doctor Pedro Recio de Agüero, native of Tirteafuera, with his whalebone wand. He looks as if he has never enjoyed a meal in his life, and doesn't want anyone else to.
