Rocinante is at the castle with your master. And the dapple is in the stable, eating a governor's barley.
/STR b6258885
{i4}"Who is down there?"{i7} {i5}"Who should it be but the wretched Sancho Panza, governor, for his sins, of the island of Barataria, once squire to the famous knight Don Quixote of La Mancha?"{i7}
/STR 37d8b493
Go down there, just like that? To get Sancho out you need a rope.
