Sancho looks at you out of the corner of his eye. He has something to ask you and doesn't know how.
/STR bc639252
The notary waits with his pen wet. The housekeeper and the niece are weeping. So is Sancho.
/STR 60bff49a
The three country girls have stopped on the road, on their young asses. Sancho, on his knees, is making signs to you.
/STR 40dcdbb9
