The lions' cart has stopped on the road. The lion keeper keeps his eyes on your lance.
/STR c1f04e34
There is a lion here with a hungry look on his face.
/STR 5d50e223
Basilio is bleeding to death on the ground, asking for Quiteria's hand. Camacho doesn't know what to do, and you have an opinion.
