Don Antonio's enchanted head stands on its jasper table.
/STR fc47e359
The Knight of the White Moon awaits your answer.
/STR 04b4bec4
The Knight of the White Moon has taken as much of the field as he needs and waits for you, lance in hand.
/STR 2fdbd15f
"The old man gave him the staff to hold just before swearing. Ask him for it, and see what is inside."
